Compile uboot:

git clone https://github.com/radxa/rkbin.git -b master --tags develop-v20240301
mv develop-v20240301 rkbin
\rm -rf u-boot
git clone --depth=1 -b v2023.01 https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot.git

To boot extlinux:
vi ./u-boot/configs/rock-pi-4-rk3399_defconfig ( append:
CONFIG_MMC_SDHCI_SDMA=y
CONFIG_NVME=y
CONFIG_CMD_NVME=y
CONFIG_BOOTMETH_EXTLINUX=y
CONFIG_BOOTMETH_EXTLINUX_PXE=y
CONFIG_BOOTSTD=y
CONFIG_BOOTSTD_FULL=y
CONFIG_BOOTFLOW=y
CONFIG_BOOTFLOW_FULL=y
CONFIG_BLOBLIST=y
CONFIG_BLOBLIST_ALLOC=y
)

To boot uefi:
vi ./u-boot/configs/rock-pi-4-rk3399_defconfig ( append:
CONFIG_MMC_SDHCI_SDMA=y
CONFIG_NVME=y
CONFIG_CMD_NVME=y
CONFIG_EFI_PARTITION=y
CONFIG_PARTITION_TYPE_GUID=y
CONFIG_CMD_GPT=y
CONFIG_CMD_PART=y
CONFIG_CMD_FS_UUID=y
CONFIG_CMD_FAT=y
CONFIG_FS_FAT=y
CONFIG_CMD_MMC=y
CONFIG_EFI_LOADER=y
CONFIG_CMD_BOOTEFI=y
CONFIG_BLOBLIST=y
CONFIG_BLOBLIST_ALLOC=y
)
vi u-boot/scripts/dtc/pylibfdt/libfdt.i_shipped search SWIG_Python_AppendOutput add ,1 after val buff
make u-boot

The results are in ./out/u-boot.img
                         trust.img
                         idbloader.img
                         uboot-trust-spi.img

make clean

------------------------------------------------------

Program spi nor flash with u-boot:

wget https://github.com/radxa/rock-pi-images-released/releases/download/v20210824/rockpi4b_debian_buster_xfce4_arm64_20210824_0233-gpt.img.gz
gunzip rockpi4b_debian_buster_xfce4_arm64_20210824_0233-gpt.img.gz

Unplug EMMC/USB-SATA-SSD/NVMe-SSD from rockpi4b
Burn rockpi4b_debian_buster_xfce4_arm64_20210824_0233-gpt.img to sdcard.
sudo mount /dev/sda4 /mnt
sudo vi /mnt/hw_intfc.conf ( change to intfc:uart4=off intfc:spi1=on intfc:dtoverlay=spi1-flash )
sync; sudo umount /mnt
Eject sdcard from PC
Boot rockpi4b with sdcard.  ( username: rock, password: rock )

Erase spi nor flash:
ls /dev ( find mtdblock0 )
sudo dd if=/dev/zero of=/dev/mtdblock0 bs=1M seek=0 count=4
sync

Install uboot to spi nor flash:
sudo dd if=./uboot-trust-spi.img of=/dev/mtdblock0 bs=1M seek=0
sync

